cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SCPTM or SCPTM-bow in academic work, please cite them as below."
title: "SCPTM: structure-aware topic modelling (neural and count-based)"
abstract: >-
  Two independent implementations of syntax-aware topic modelling: scptm
  (contextual embeddings, dependency graph, variational graph encoder) and
  scptm-bow (dependency-regularised NMF over a lemmatised bag of words).
authors:
